<title>UK: Spain's ICO prices $500 mln five-year bond, +16 bp.</title>
<headline>Spain's ICO prices $500 mln five-year bond, +16 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Goldman Sachs International said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INSTITUTO DE CREDITO OFFICIAL</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SPAIN</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    02.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.298   PAY DATE    17.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.673    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 30.NOV.01</p>
<p> NOTES   ***US/UK/DE/ES/JP. LONG FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
